{
  "protocol": "CHEN authentic single-passage prompt-grouped OOF, with the fold-fitted 76-feature GLM head and corrected final style. Test the fixed V30 projection in isolation, disabling it, and estimating a batch-dependent shrinkage capped at the original rho=.35. It compares the estimated sampling variance of the class means with their squared distance from the smoothed training prior. Moderate shift keeps 50\u2013100% of each label. For strong shifts, randomly assign the 12-class temporal frequency pattern to the 18 labels. Resample inside each validation fold, then recompute all batch selection and calibration. Published raw-probability projection matched original V30 code bit-for-bit. This repeats the same 150 training prompts; the temporal 1360-row cohort motivated the experiment.",
